OL,3,GNEWSASuicide prevention charity enters
OL,4,Aadministration
OL,5,
OL,6,FA suicide prevention charity, which
OL,7,Freceived more than #1.5m of funding
OL,8,Ffrom the 3 Dads Walking group, has gone
OL,9,Finto administration.
OL,11,FOpus Restructuring and Insolvency said
OL,12,Fits appointment as administrators for
OL,13,FPapyrus Prevention of Young Suicide had
OL,14,Ffollowed an "extended and extremely
OL,15,Fdifficult period" for the charity.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
