OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSASuicide prevention charity enters
OL,4,Aadministration
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 3 Dads Walking, Andy Airey from
OL,7,FCumbria, Mike Palmer from Greater
OL,8,FManchester and Tim Owen from Norfolk,
OL,9,Feach lost a daughter ` Sophie, Beth and
OL,10,FEmily - to suicide. They said they
OL,11,Ffound it "very difficult to accept"
OL,12,FPapyrus was closing.
OL,14,FChair of Papyrus trustees Harry
OL,15,FBiggs-Davison said: "It has been almost
OL,16,Funbearable for us trustees to have had
OL,17,Fto make the decision."
